#: scenario7:scenario7_BACD08A1_9263_4A2D_8B26_1FF261B8F58D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc4909cc345385260161bece5f4fd0f65e2e26093728ea74584b9b939baebeff
#. default-sha256: 0078bc0d02fa312c54fddf2713f6fd6c0895b22215541d53585a222d61654fa7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BACD08A1_9263_4A2D_8B26_1FF261B8F58D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Michelle! Ohh Mich⟪k:8⟫eeee⟪k:9⟫eeeelle! Are you in there?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫おーい、⟪k:8⟫ミシェルー！　⟪k:9⟫ミシェルってばー、⟪k:10⟫い"
"るかいー？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FB32878E_3B65_40D1_962A_0B9F5ADBCA69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 462bd44783ad7687af4c853560118d27777f0eafba1f62492f90fb86422f362a
#. default-sha256: 84781efa535e75fac2b7c3e05c75e01b7ff105a74fdc3a72f547770a611aa91f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FB32878E_3B65_40D1_962A_0B9F5ADBCA69"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Did you need something, Georges?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ジョルジュ兄さん。⟪k:3⟫何か、⟪k:4⟫用事でもありましたか？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A55F8FEF_1AB7_4FE2_986A_3FBBE54321B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59a3efbb9b1a51c6f4d7d20cca8bd997596e2b0e30d0467b873ff47027616c79
#. default-sha256: a3369c02467e7b91af5d71fc4203b464066a959d76fbc1557ec0d6ab71bdf38e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A55F8FEF_1AB7_4FE2_986A_3FBBE54321B0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, c’mon, don’t be like that.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Do I have to “need something” to talk to you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ちょっとつれないこと言わないでよ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫用事なんかなくたって、⟪k:4⟫話しかけにきてい"
"いじゃない？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3ED6DA89_DABD_4E8E_A636_8C03D240695F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 431bc6d260f3e864ccade026a59af96ef42666208f1c17a7787fd6cc3ca7e35f
#. default-sha256: 1b02f44964903e78a69ae26497bb926ee8e499894e1e4477af0692f7cc64d332
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3ED6DA89_DABD_4E8E_A636_8C03D240695F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫N-⟪k:2⟫No, but you looked like you were in an unusually good mood,⟪k:3⟫so I thought..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫そ、⟪k:2⟫そうですけど。⟪k:3⟫なんだか楽しそうだったので、⟪k:4⟫何かと……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CF12D587_2FF9_4EE4_991C_31AAEB65C73E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 051708beb94dbd95425c65585d82fd76ca9e8fac09c51800cdedc18d17066eb6
#. default-sha256: 7a9ca4c6a11e995722bd9e606d2953ba0e84de088d2b10c99c598950319e6974
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CF12D587_2FF9_4EE4_991C_31AAEB65C73E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, why wouldn’t I be?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It’s a wonderfully gloomy day out!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫だってホラ、⟪k:2⟫今日ったら絶好の曇り日和じゃない！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B074DBC1_FA01_4CC8_954A_6C085E79F2EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29154af8fbb066a95a261000252902316be88f77faf917b534eb4ec2f6eb8b6a
