msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2F81EBB3_F8A2_41F0_93EE_05BA4326A48B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 397699c0969594f1ec8bba67a2daa652760f87cc7eb4e5ed8d7bb78ceb1e3b09
#. default-sha256: e8c9d89304fab725f6d717e56ad17c4c013074e9a34eda9e10e91bfcd2cfa80e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2F81EBB3_F8A2_41F0_93EE_05BA4326A48B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I would understand if it were clear out...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but can you really say it’s "
"“wonderfully” gloomy?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫いや、⟪k:2⟫晴れなら分かりますけど、⟪k:3⟫曇りにその台詞って合うんですか……？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_DFA0EF82_350D_475B_8014_D38E3E4E9C6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8214ca6de70ffdc188bfb2be8be151469d06f1167e7b9aa587694e17bd90641
#. default-sha256: 69f19b90a14c7775736fec3580d31c631afeec669ac20634d72855ac3dc083ef
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DFA0EF82_350D_475B_8014_D38E3E4E9C6F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, you can’t be outside for very long when it’s not cloudy, so in our case, this is "
"perfect weather."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫だって晴れたら、⟪k:2⟫ミシェルはあんまり外を歩けないじゃん。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ぼくらにとっては絶"
"好に違いないサ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E1821575_CA6E_403F_8D30_4330B21534A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f2321d845a9315aae2d75531cb2e4be40ec5846c329b4260394e625049ff70b
#. default-sha256: 87e27f1a4bd2dd9b5227b9dd62074a7a563ea0ca665892f1fa6ebfc0c7aa097c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E1821575_CA6E_403F_8D30_4330B21534A6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫あ………。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C01E4773_3075_4DCE_B133_8C7266956346
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ab63df17fefd798d873eb529d286886f4005832fa9300c53d853d2d84db9093
#. default-sha256: c7aab9b58c5d175672b07a186f4278dfb3bd67d8f3e7ee27597a9d3a2399c32c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C01E4773_3075_4DCE_B133_8C7266956346"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What do you say we go for a little stroll, while we can?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dee’s around today "
"too, so we can see if he’s up for it.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It’ll be like old times."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫せっかくだから散歩に行こうよ。⟪k:2⟫今日は兄貴も家にいるはずだから、⟪k:3⟫あいつも誘って"
"サ。⟪k:4⟫昔はよく、⟪k:5⟫みんなで出かけたでしょう？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9406F46A_7FED_421F_A304_80D3F5789C3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2551134c4f82f76bdfbd20834557f60996623c61bb8da73a1f2a7b57c37e9ab0
#. default-sha256: 9443e97f8e3f298a47eefe0217785aa5f1e758c2eabe10157d583a7f6c2674fd
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9406F46A_7FED_421F_A304_80D3F5789C3F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫We’ve been running around like headless chickens lately,⟪k:2⟫so we haven’t had much of "
"a chance for a sibling outing.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We’ll have Mom make us a lunch, and then—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫最近はなんだかんだ、⟪k:2⟫ぼくとか兄貴が忙しくなっちゃって、⟪k:3⟫ご無沙汰だけど。⟪k:4⟫前"
"みたいに母さんに弁当を作ってもらって――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2086E62F_87B2_47C7_B186_8D57CAE02078
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1209ac07c48247c33b212891733d3c1964ac5d92b9b34266adc97d5ee5829b97
#. default-sha256: e796e10a39a90de49242e4cfe539dcbf2edaa59b9b1f32eedbffe397fa8d3ae1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2086E62F_87B2_47C7_B186_8D57CAE02078"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ooh, we’ll take a couple horses up to the forest’s edge!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫馬に乗って、⟪k:2⟫森の方まで！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_AB202D56_42D8_44B8_855B_BA820064EA7D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7da27f59189b0c4619ed618d6150e70dfd05a04710b35e4d2b23e310c558fda3
#. default-sha256: 454d385a03bfc07085aaed255dc36a2da78272cfaba4707ab03a2970eab8e24f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AB202D56_42D8_44B8_855B_BA820064EA7D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I-⟪k:2⟫I’m fine with that if you are."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……は、⟪k:2⟫はい。⟪k:3⟫兄さんたちが、⟪k:4⟫大丈夫なら。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1CC04FBE_D7D3_499E_8D23_9241BEE32370
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f53fc9b2316a3059b5d1c58e38d6537ee45e97a710e937115c1c9d0c0d5fa773
#. default-sha256: 2a6d557cda124838f7956cf1b8bed9178dcd29ef15e85f394e8fa8527a8b5e60
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1CC04FBE_D7D3_499E_8D23_9241BEE32370"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You bet your bum I am. I asked, after all!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Now c’mon, let’s go!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫むろんのこと、⟪k:2⟫大丈夫に決まっているじゃないかっ。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫サアサア、⟪k:5⟫行こう行こ"
"う！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_34D266ED_1135_4E45_9C31_EA6D46852228
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1619d5751aa8c889cbbf2d0291efc4617c79e766d342c997b03038cad59cd8f
#. default-sha256: 1fe335a7274e1aa77da76c751e867d3386026d2bd901498c8fcf428cf48a9d64
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_34D266ED_1135_4E45_9C31_EA6D46852228"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫An outing, you say?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫なに？　⟪k:8⟫散歩？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_54C4A907_7278_42D2_914B_8485A57F286B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40a84d2e664a437b2edad1449640ff7825dac95b28415bccf4161881a06063e2
#. default-sha256: 9279c076fb14338f8cadfccc7c9429eb3615a601c9015096a32f3b40455d5cec
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_54C4A907_7278_42D2_914B_8485A57F286B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Yepyep. Hop on a couple horses and head for the forest.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We haven’t done "
"this in a while, so I figured why not."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫そうそう、⟪k:3⟫ちょっと森の方まで、⟪k:4⟫馬を飛ばしてサ。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫久しぶりにみんな"
"で出かけてみないかって話。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C7FE1404_21B8_4AFB_ACBC_CE0D1EBB2D6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f5a8247ab8abc9d3499ce059c47fdcfc090a91198541204915e0c83432a4c07
#. default-sha256: 1ef2387dd0188313a3062739e36b866f09e2967210daabc62e0ab58a500037b7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C7FE1404_21B8_4AFB_ACBC_CE0D1EBB2D6E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I see. Well, if Michelle is coming, I see no reason to say no.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Let’s set off "
"right away."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫そうか、⟪k:2⟫ミシェルも一緒ならば、⟪k:3⟫断る理由もない。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫すぐに行こうじゃない"
"か。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0439C8F3_C6DE_422D_BA4F_F3A310E5967F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7aa39f9bc0c0daf1ef1766b83913315cec4854390348c9c8a8e9a991e2f4a2ec
#. default-sha256: 4308f4e5f5ecb780b4f1fb31d9791e2aa0b785287646d7355fd9be4fd703f316
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0439C8F3_C6DE_422D_BA4F_F3A310E5967F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Whoa, whoa, slow down there.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Are you saying you wouldn’t go if it was just me?"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It’s Michelle or nothing?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫あれ、⟪k:2⟫ちょっと待って、⟪k:3⟫それってミシェルが居なかったら断るってこと？⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫ぼ"
"くだけじゃダメってこと？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8DF16205_0566_4025_B2D9_528D1AA14340
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c539cc875c9f0e57b76f477eef240920c4d1dd79d39af534bdf4f242ec75108
#. default-sha256: 16f619918e54c35f2087e08145dbe975bb6e817d0fe9b3ead846e24f600ac271
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8DF16205_0566_4025_B2D9_528D1AA14340"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Of course. Why on earth would I want to go horse-riding alone with you? ⟪k:2⟫I would "
"rather drown myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫当たり前だろう、⟪k:2⟫なんで私がお前と二人で散歩になんか行かねばならんのだ。⟪k:3⟫絶対にお"
"断りだ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D6BBF839_251E_423D_AD38_1E3477201973
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77a900815815777000116a292721fa12e013f475b6ccbfbf04b1fe5f933a5c61
#. default-sha256: ac69fcfc56fe648e21efc3b342743b878e8e3b7df77ca73d8f1184e7bbca22cd
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D6BBF839_251E_423D_AD38_1E3477201973"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫LE GAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASP!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫がーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーん……！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F4B2BA61_62B5_4150_BFC7_104328D10817
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ed1f0329d0a7aa569b6b70e85a33c94d038fb9d2745019b3847dedbd6d57c1f
#. default-sha256: 7519ac303976e65752d2505956fa3755cbd866383aeee6d661dd153a38da7f43
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F4B2BA61_62B5_4150_BFC7_104328D10817"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Um, Didier... ⟪k:4⟫could I, perhaps, make a small request?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫あの……ディディエ兄さん。⟪k:4⟫ひとつ、⟪k:5⟫お願いがあるのですが。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D5201F50_0026_463D_ACA6_0B41AE96A802
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae1d9d53e276636e05dda01a88f30ca7de26891553aa9cbfc2ceab4b2b565b79
#. default-sha256: 8506fd714c4b0f112aedf7294523f69b6989096acbc4971aa0cc4f467d241346
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D5201F50_0026_463D_ACA6_0B41AE96A802"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Go on, let’s hear it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ん、⟪k:2⟫なんだ？　⟪k:3⟫言ってみなさい。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_50A8EFA1_E5B5_46CF_BAFF_2E5A5D2666AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab7bd2babbfc6f244cb5b491cf6cc3297ef6497fedf2f43b6b768f4ba790b0d1
#. default-sha256: b207c5351d25d1791059dfd77418d6b5464055910d319d76dfefb8e065365bac
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_50A8EFA1_E5B5_46CF_BAFF_2E5A5D2666AC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do you mind if I... ⟪k:2⟫hold the horse’s reins?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫馬の手綱を握るの……、⟪k:2⟫私がやってもいいですか。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CD4C7EE4_B103_480B_8DB0_1A19F8854021
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae81bcbf0dbbd43ce634627526273e2367ceb6b6d9e578a84b2785098a813c13
#. default-sha256: bb28d42a6f173925a841a1b3046e00ad4f9a8a6e9678061c9d1fdfd18488bddc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CD4C7EE4_B103_480B_8DB0_1A19F8854021"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, that’s all? By all means.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’ll be there behind you to make sure nothing "
"happens, so have at it."
msgstr ""
