msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The line between dream and reality blurred.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I often found myself screaming, crying "
"into the empty air."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫悪夢と現実の境界が曖昧になり――、⟪k:1⟫たったひとりで悲鳴を上げて、⟪k:2⟫喚いたことも、⟪k:3⟫多々"
